WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:10.490
Show the mall's live numbers on a TV in the office or control room, with a private link that needs no sign-in.

2
00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:18.100
The wall screen puts the mall's live numbers on a TV in the office or the control room.

3
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:24.830
It turns through these panels: visitors, the car park, takings, work orders and cheques due.

4
00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:34.300
Create a link for the TV. It works without signing in, so use it only on a screen you trust.

5
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:42.060
Open this address in the TV's browser. Make a new link or switch it off at any time.

6
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:47.350
Choose the screen's language and how long each panel stays.

7
00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.420
Save.

8
00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.620
And this is the screen. It refreshes every thirty seconds by itself.
